WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:49.370 --> 00:01:52.700
Remember this, commander of the Hi Shin Unit:

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:54.500
My name is Ou Hon.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.620
Ou Hon...

00:01:56.620 --> 00:01:58.620
Ou...?

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:00.830
Ou?!

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:05.500
Yes. Of the same clan as your beloved Ou Ki.

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:07.620
Unlike Ou Ki, from a mere branch,

00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:11.250
<i>this</i> Ou carries on the main family's name!

00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:20.370
Go through hell along with your men.

00:02:20.370 --> 00:02:23.540
You do have the aptitude... <i>Shin</i> .

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:51.770
"The Third Force"

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:57.540
What's with that Ou Hon upstart?

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.620
So we're ants, are we?

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:02.620
We should just shut up and follow orders?

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:04.790
Who the hell does he think he is?!

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:13.290
Still... we can hardly argue.

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:12.170
"Ryuu Yuu: Sergeant"

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:15.370
Just one shout from that big guy

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:17.550
"Kyo Gai: Sergeant"

00:03:15.370 --> 00:03:17.830
and we all snapped to attention.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:23.790
Man... haven't been reminded of <i>that</i> in a while.

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:30.250
That huge, impassable wall
between us and those noble types...

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:34.500
But...

00:03:34.500 --> 00:03:38.080
...that Gyoku Hou Force was pretty cool.

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:43.250
Kou, you punk! <i>What</i> did you just say?

00:03:43.250 --> 00:03:45.290
S-Sorry!

00:03:45.290 --> 00:03:48.500
Are you completely clueless or what?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:50.910
Cut it out, Bi Hei.

00:03:50.910 --> 00:03:55.870
Nothin' wrong with bein' honest
and sayin' what's on your mind.

00:03:55.870 --> 00:04:00.290
The Gyoku Hou Force <i>was</i> pretty cool.
They practically gleamed.

00:04:00.290 --> 00:04:01.950
Right, Kou?

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:04.580
Y-Yeah...

00:04:04.580 --> 00:04:07.580
You wanna be like them?

00:04:07.580 --> 00:04:10.580
Rack up a ton of victories and you can.

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.540
You can join the warrior class!

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:15.580
Me? A-A noble?

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:20.410
Shou Sa! Cut that crap
about walls, 'specially now.

00:04:20.410 --> 00:04:23.040
That's nothin' but an excuse.

00:04:23.040 --> 00:04:24.370
An excuse?

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:31.790
Yep. All it does is let 'em
overpower us, get us down.

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:37.580
If we let ourselves get beaten
like that, we lose our will to fight.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:39.620
We're not playin' around!

00:04:39.620 --> 00:04:44.790
General Ou Ki's relative or no,
I'm not gonna take this lyin' down!

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.120
Now it's <i>our</i> turn!

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.290
We're gonna take what they
gave us and give it right back!

00:05:00.830 --> 00:05:06.040
Give it back? But fighting
allies'll get us court-martialed...

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:08.290
Don't you get it, Kou?

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:14.870
He means we're gonna start
beatin' that Gyoku Hou Force to the punch!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:19.700
The only question is: how?

00:05:19.700 --> 00:05:23.370
We're going to need
a special strategy to surpass

00:05:23.370 --> 00:05:27.450
the mounted Gyoku Hou Force.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:30.410
And that's exactly what
we're gonna work on now.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:39.540
I have an idea!

00:05:39.540 --> 00:05:41.540
Ro En?

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:45.750
A harsh strategy that only we can pull off...

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:48.500
Harsh, eh?

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:57.290
Did you hear the news, Ou Hon, sir?

00:05:57.290 --> 00:06:00.540
It seems the Hi Shin Unit we met the other day

00:06:00.540 --> 00:06:02.950
went missing that night.

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:05.950
Other units have been searching for them.

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:10.200
It appears stealing their thunder
and showing them our superior strength

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.000
had quite the effect.

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:17.870
They're probably back in the sticks
by now, working the fields!

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:57.000
What the hell?!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:07:02.080
Ow ow ow! Damn stray bit me!

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:03.500
Dammit, Bi Hei...

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:13.950
Get lost, you mongrel!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.870
Here they come... Gi troops...

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:39.330
Okay, Ro En, tell me about
this "harsh strategy" of yours.

00:07:39.330 --> 00:07:43.500
The Gi army is gathering up
its scattered soldiers

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:46.540
to get its encampments in order.

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:50.250
Such large enemy gatherings
give us the ideal chance

00:07:50.250 --> 00:07:53.120
to pull off something big.

00:07:53.120 --> 00:07:58.790
However, with all the
enemies we'd have to fight

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.750
on our way to the main force,
our small group is at a disadvantage.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:08.870
Luckily, not only is the fog thick here,
but the bodies of those lost

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:12.160
in the ongoing hostilities
have been left where they fell.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:20.450
If we disguise ourselves
among the fog and the bodies,

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:25.290
we can sneak up to the main force
without engaging the enemy.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:28.620
However...

00:08:28.620 --> 00:08:30.870
know that being among these rotting corpses

00:08:30.870 --> 00:08:35.040
will be far more trying
than crossing swords with the foe.

00:08:58.620 --> 00:09:01.160
What is it, Kou? You all right?

00:09:01.160 --> 00:09:03.120
You're white as a ghost!

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:05.410
I-I'm fine.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.700
Here they come again! Hide!

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:11.540
A-All for the warrior class!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:20.410
I'm gonna be nobility and bring my
poor single mother some happiness!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.950
Kou...

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:25.950
Well, Ou Hon?

00:09:25.950 --> 00:09:30.250
Does your Gyoku Hou Force
have the guts to go this far?

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:36.450
Once those guys go past,
we rush the main enemy force!

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:41.750
Hmm?

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:45.000
What?

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:50.160
I thought I saw something moving over there.

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:52.000
Hey, you!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:55.160
Go make sure no one's still alive out there!

00:09:55.160 --> 00:09:56.580
Yes, sir!

00:10:07.870 --> 00:10:09.540
You've gotta be kiddin'...

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:18.580
Now what? Do we just fight 'em here?

00:10:18.580 --> 00:10:21.750
No, we let them pass us by.

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:24.790
If they spot us now, this'll all be for nothing.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.870
We'll never be able to storm the main force.

00:10:27.870 --> 00:10:31.620
And with so many dead bodies...

00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:35.910
the Gi troops can only stab so many.

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:39.410
That's right. No way <i>we'll</i> get...

00:10:44.200 --> 00:10:46.160
M-Kou!

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.660
Get out of there, Kou!

00:10:53.660 --> 00:10:58.620
Nothing doing! If I move,
they'll figure out our plan!

00:11:06.750 --> 00:11:10.000
<i>Kou</i> !

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.450
Mother...!

00:11:37.200 --> 00:11:38.620
Well?

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:42.410
Sir! There appear to be no survivors!

00:11:42.410 --> 00:11:45.250
I see. Must've been my imagination.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:46.410
Move out!

00:11:58.580 --> 00:11:59.580
Kou...

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.500
The Gyoku Hou Force is coming!

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:20.870
We can't let them reach our
main force! Stop them in their tracks!

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.660
S-Stop them!

00:12:32.540 --> 00:12:36.080
Easy pickings again, eh, sir?

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.540
It's not over yet.

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.620
We can't relax until
their general's head is ours!

00:12:40.620 --> 00:12:44.250
Now we just have to take down their main force!

00:12:57.120 --> 00:13:01.040
You're a little too late, Gyoku Hou Force!

00:13:01.040 --> 00:13:06.200
You and your pretty ponies
were shown up by a bunch of <i>ants</i> !

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.790
Guess that military training
wasn't worth much after all,

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:11.870
little lord Ou Hon!

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.990
"Ou Hon"

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.540
They did it again!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.620
The Gyoku Hou Force has taken
another enemy general's head!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.160
This time it was the Hi Shin Unit
that took down the enemy camp!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:44.080
Those two 300-man squadrons are amazing!

00:13:44.080 --> 00:13:47.200
It's win after win with them--
like they're playing off each other!

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:50.830
Sure, but the Gyoku Hou Force is still better.

00:13:50.830 --> 00:13:55.580
That armed and mounted squadron
is stronger than a thousand men!

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:59.040
They've got nothing on the Hi Shin Unit.

00:13:59.040 --> 00:14:05.500
Those guys gladly do the dirty work
no other squadron would dare!

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:06.870
Aw...

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:11.080
Things certainly are heating up
around here again.

00:14:11.080 --> 00:14:14.950
Seems this new Hi Shin Unit
is competing with the Gyoku Hou Force

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.160
to get results on the battlefield.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:20.000
How amusing to think of Ou Hon,

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.250
flustered at having to share the glory.

00:14:22.250 --> 00:14:23.950
What do you think?

00:14:23.950 --> 00:14:28.370
Shall our Gaku Ka Force join this fight?

00:14:24.050 --> 00:14:28.050
"Gaku Ka Force"

00:14:28.370 --> 00:14:29.700
Mou Ten, sir!

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:34.060
"Mou Ten: Commander, Gaku Ka Force"
"Chin Army Special 300-Man Squadron"

00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:36.370
Nah.

00:14:36.370 --> 00:14:37.700
Wha-a-at?!

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.950
It's just... Ou Hon is a pain...

00:14:39.950 --> 00:14:42.870
...and besides, it's so hot out.

00:14:42.870 --> 00:14:47.120
Too hot to play games
with them in such a tight space.

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:48.750
As expected!

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:52.790
The young master takes
a much broader view of war.

00:14:52.790 --> 00:14:55.370
It makes this old man so happy!

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:57.790
Try not to cry.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:01.330
If that's how you feel,
shall the Gaku Ka Force search

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:06.120
for a grander and more fitting battlefield?

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.660
Well, actually...

00:15:07.660 --> 00:15:11.330
...this whole 300-man squadron thing
is taking the wind out of my sails.

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.160
Wha-a-at?!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:16.910
See, I did great in that last Kan battle, right?

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:20.290
I should totally be bumped up
to a 1000-man squad by now.

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.330
This is true...

00:15:21.330 --> 00:15:25.750
But Lord Haku Rou said
to get another year's experience

00:15:25.750 --> 00:15:27.910
commanding 300 men...

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:31.330
You can't just defy his command.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:36.620
My grandpa is especially rough
on those near and dear to him.

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:38.200
Poor me...

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:39.620
Poor young master!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:42.870
I <i>said</i> , try not to cry!

00:15:42.870 --> 00:15:44.160
Shall we?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.160
Sir!

00:15:47.500 --> 00:15:53.250
There's a front line south of here
with an even bigger battle unfolding.

00:15:53.250 --> 00:15:55.410
Let's head there!

00:15:55.410 --> 00:16:00.750
But first, let's find a nice lively town...
for some shopping.

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:03.290
Wha-a-at?!

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:07.700
And so, two years after the death of Ou Ki,

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:11.370
the last of Chin's very own six great generals,

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:13.870
Ou Hon of the Gyoku Hou Force,

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.450
Mou Ten of the Gaku Ka Force,

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:19.370
and Shin of the Hi Shin Unit

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:25.580
all vied to be Chin's great
general for a new generation.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:29.790
These young men saw
much action on the battlefield

00:16:29.790 --> 00:16:33.540
as they steadily grew
and developed their skills.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:36.700
Meanwhile, a great force was beginning to stir

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:40.700
in the Chin capital of Kanyou.

00:16:40.700 --> 00:16:43.330
We have word that there are
already a thousand hangers-on

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:47.120
gathered under Ryo Fui.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:50.160
And that the peasants in the regions we control

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.450
now number over 100 thousand.

00:16:52.450 --> 00:16:55.330
We're well beyond the single-retainer stage now.

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:58.870
And entering into that alliance with Sho

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:02.120
made them that much more valuable.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:04.750
Ryo Fui will only get bigger.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:10.870
Ryo Fui's faction doesn't
plan on using military might

00:17:10.870 --> 00:17:14.040
to crush those of us on the King's side.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:18.040
They mean to form a one-sided
power relationship, weaken us,

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:21.830
and snuff out the advisors remaining at the end,

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:24.750
rendering the King powerless.

00:17:24.750 --> 00:17:29.620
Then what we must do is the exact opposite.

00:17:29.620 --> 00:17:34.040
We can only pull the balance
of power within the Royal Court

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:36.450
over to His Highness's favor.

00:17:36.450 --> 00:17:39.450
We've known that for a while now!

00:17:39.450 --> 00:17:42.500
Which is why Shou Bun Kun is working hard

00:17:42.500 --> 00:17:44.750
on the flood control project.

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.950
But that's not enough.

00:17:47.950 --> 00:17:54.500
We need a bigger strategy
to pull the neutral parties to our side!

00:17:54.500 --> 00:17:57.330
Like what, exactly?

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:04.330
What is it, Shi Shi? Why so quiet?

00:18:04.330 --> 00:18:07.700
Are you not the one who called today's meeting?

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:15.660
Then... if you'll permit me to speak, Sire.

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:19.910
As we've discussed,
in order for us in the King's faction

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.950
to gain real power and
hold back Ryo Fui's faction,

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:27.160
we must change the balance
of power within the Royal Court.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:32.330
The fastest way to do so is
to bring power onto our side.

00:18:32.330 --> 00:18:35.250
But with the remnants of Ketsu Shi's
faction--including you--

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:37.790
now chiefly on the King's side,

00:18:37.790 --> 00:18:43.540
there cannot be enough power
here in Kanyou to turn the tables!

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:45.700
Ah... but there is.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:54.040
Some among us today know as much,
but do not dare put it to voice.

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.950
Some may have noticed at all.

00:18:56.950 --> 00:19:02.160
But here in Kanyou, there is a third force,

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:06.000
separate from both Ryo Fui's
faction and the King's.

00:19:06.000 --> 00:19:10.750
A great force, one with which
even Ryo Fui struggles to engage!

00:19:10.750 --> 00:19:12.450
Enough, Shi Shi!

00:19:12.450 --> 00:19:15.200
You are in the presence of His Highness!

00:19:15.200 --> 00:19:19.500
Besides... that is somewhere we cannot tread.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:22.540
Exactly so.

00:19:22.540 --> 00:19:25.250
But what if <i>they</i> reached out to <i>us</i> ?

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:31.120
What has happened, Shi Shi?

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:34.870
You see... last night...

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:38.870
...they appeared at my residence:

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:42.540
messengers from <i>that</i> castle.

00:19:42.540 --> 00:19:44.500
Wh-Why...

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:47.750
Why are you... here?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:53.000
Shi Shi... I bear a missive.

00:19:56.330 --> 00:19:59.830
Th-The Royal Seal!

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:03.700
Royal Seal? What nonsense!

00:20:03.700 --> 00:20:08.870
Why, the Royal Seal stays with the King!

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.580
No Seal-bearing message could possibly arrive

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:15.750
from a place of which the King has no knowledge!

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:18.700
What are you going on about?!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:21.950
Earlier, when the King's
younger half-brother Sei Kyou

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.750
had sparked that uprising,

00:20:24.750 --> 00:20:28.000
the Royal Seal was concealed in a certain place

00:20:28.000 --> 00:20:30.910
as the King fled Kanyou.

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:33.080
As part of Sei Kyou's faction at the time,

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:36.370
I had been unable to uncover the Seal.

00:20:36.370 --> 00:20:40.950
That is because it was hidden among
the third force of which I now speak.

00:20:45.450 --> 00:20:49.500
Do you mean the Seal was duplicated
before it was returned to me

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:51.700
after quelling the uprising?

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:55.410
Blasphemy!

00:20:55.410 --> 00:20:58.500
Duplicating the Royal Seal
is treason against the kingdom,

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:01.290
a misuse punishable by death!

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:04.790
What exactly are you driving at?!

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:06.950
This "third force"--

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:11.580
I've never heard of anything
like it here in Kanyou!

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:14.500
No, Heki...

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:19.700
You do know of that force.

00:21:19.700 --> 00:21:24.410
Being distracted by its different nature

00:21:24.410 --> 00:21:26.540
has simply kept you from recognizing it

00:21:26.540 --> 00:21:29.790
as having anything to do
with our power struggles.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:36.160
It is in Kanyou, though even the
most elite are not permitted entrance.

00:21:36.160 --> 00:21:38.000
The sealed castle...

00:21:43.250 --> 00:21:45.290
Bow down!

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:22.290
Don't look up, Kou--no matter what.

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:25.660
I-I know, You.

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:42.410
A castle of over a thousand
court ladies and countless eunuchs.

00:22:42.410 --> 00:22:46.290
Most of the ladies are of distinguished
families both here and abroad.

00:22:46.290 --> 00:22:51.870
Behind it all lurk the power
and ambition of an influential figure.

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:55.580
Taken all together,

00:22:55.580 --> 00:22:59.000
it makes for an enormously
powerful castle of women:

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.950
the Inner Palace.

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:07.250
And the ruler of that castle of women
is the Queen Dowager of Chin.

00:23:07.250 --> 00:23:08.700
In other words...

00:23:08.700 --> 00:23:11.080
This "third force" is none other than

00:23:11.080 --> 00:23:14.500
the power of His Highness's mother!

00:23:48.830 --> 00:23:51.750
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:23:51.750 --> 00:23:54.830
<i>Why would the voice that melted into the sky</i>

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:59.450
<i>Peel away and disappear?</i>

00:24:00.790 --> 00:24:03.790
<i>Just a single word</i>

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:06.830
<i>If that's all you'd say</i>

00:24:06.830 --> 00:24:11.700
<i>What kind of word would you choose?</i>

00:24:12.540 --> 00:24:15.910
<i>Holding my breath and making sure</i>

00:24:15.910 --> 00:24:18.870
<i>The heartbeat can't wait</i>

00:24:18.870 --> 00:24:24.830
<i>If I let go of your hand, I'll want even more</i>

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:28.450
<i>And so I keep on doing this</i>

00:24:28.450 --> 00:24:30.910
<i>Not allowing myself to stop</i>

00:24:30.910 --> 00:24:35.700
<i>Because I'm still searching for answers</i>

00:24:35.700 --> 00:24:39.370
<i>I want you to tell me</i>

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:46.200
<i>Before you melt away into the sky</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"Exquisite Poison"
